02.5 48261.1 44852.5 427.6  348.5 338.5 253.9 \n  NOTE: # till 30th September, 2015 \n * No employment exchange is functioning in this state. "}, {"k": "questions|ls|16|12|UNSTARRED |109", "t": "Model Villages for Tribals", "head": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA \n(MINISTRY OF TRIBAL AFFAIRS) \nLOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION No. †109 \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 17.07.2017 \n \nMODEL VILLAGES FOR TRIBALS \n \n†109. SHRI LAKHAN LAL SAHU:  \nWill the Minister of TRIBAL AFFAIRS be pleased to state: \n \n(a) whether the Government has formulated/has any proposal to formulate a \nprogramme for developing model village for the scheduled tribe communities in the \ncountry; \n(b)  if so, the details thereof including the salient features of this programme along \nwith the names of villages identified for this purpose, State/UT -wise including \nChhattisgarh; and  \n(c)  the amount of funds allocated and utilised by the various States thereunder during \neach of the last three years and the current year, State/UT-wise? \n \nANSWER \n \nMINISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF TRIBAL AFFAIRS \n(SHRI JASWANTSINH BHABHOR) \n \n(a): There is no proposal / programme in the Ministry to develop model villages for \nScheduled Tribe (ST) communities in the country.   \n \n(b) & (c): Does not arise in view of (a) above.   \n \n \n**** \n "}, {"k": "questions|ls|16|12|UNSTARRED |11", "t": "Preservation of Manuscripts", "head": "           \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA\n \nMINISTRY OF CULTURE\n \n \nLOK SABHA\n \n \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 11\n \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 17.07.2017\n \n \nPRESERVATION OF MANUSCRIPTS\n \n11. \nSHRI MAHEISH GIRRI\n:\n��\n��\n������������������������������������������\nCULTURE \n����������������������������������������\n��\n��\n������\n��\n��\n��\n����������������������������������������\n��������������\n��\n������������������������������������������������������������\n����������������������������������������������������\n����������\n��\n���������������������������������������������������������