hand to\n \nimprove their living standard?\n \n \nANSWER\n \n \nMINISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF AGRICULTURE\n \nAND FA\nRMERS WELFARE\n \n \nकृ\u0000ष\n \nएवं \n\u0000कसान \nक\u0000याण \nमं\u0000ालय म\u0000 रा\u0000य मं\u0000ी\n \n \n   \n(SHRI\n \nPARSHOTTAM RUPALA\n)\n \n \n(\na)\n:\n \n \nAgriculture is a state subject. However, Department of Agriculture Cooperation & \nFarmers Welfare is implementing Agriculture Schemes for the welfare of farmers throughout t\nhe \ncountry including Jharkhand.  These schemes are aimed at welfare of the farmers including \ntribal population of Jharkhand. \n \n \n(b)\n:\n \n \nThe list of schemes currently implemented/ run by Department of Agriculture \nCooperation & Farmers Welfare for the welfare o\nf the farmers in Jharkhand are given at \nannexure\n-\nI.\n \n \n(c)\n:\n \n  \nDetails of funds allocated and released under various schemes implemented in the \nState of Jharkhand during 2014\n-\n15 to 2016\n-\n17 is at annexure\n-\nII.\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \nAnnexure\n-\nI\n \nName of the Scheme\n \n1\n \nNati\nonal  Food Security Mission\n \n(NFSM)\n \n2\n \nIntegrated Scheme of oilseeds, Pulses,\n \nOil Palm and Maize \n(ISOPOM)\n \nNow,  \nNational Mission on Oilseeds & Oil Palm \n(NMOOP)\n \n3\n \nRainfed Area Development \n(RAD) Now, \n \nRainfed Area Development & Climate Change\n \n4\n \nNational Pro\nject on Management Soil Hea\nl\nth and Fertility   \n(NPMSH&F)\n \nNow,  \nSoil Health Management\n \n(SHM)\n \n5\n \nSoil Health Card\n \n(SHC)\n \n6\n \nParamparagat Krishi Vikas Yojana\n \n(PKVY)  \n \n7\n \nSupport to State Extension Programme for Extension Reforms\n \nNow,  \nSub\n-\nmission on Agricultur\ne Extension \n(SMAE)\n \n8\n \nSub\n-\nmission on Agriculture Mechanization\n \n(SMAM)\n \n9\n \nSub\n-\n \nmission on Seeds and Planting Material\n \n(SMSP)\n \n10\n \nNational Horticulture Mission \n(NHM)\n \n11\n \nNational Bamboo Mission\n \n(NBM) Now , \n \nNational Agroforesty & Bambo